{"id": "1791491", "name": "האם תת הסדרה מתכנסת", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "an", "params": ["n"], "body": "sin(%pi*n /(2*aa))"}, {"name": "bn", "params": ["n"], "body": "(aa*n)"}, {"name": "cn", "params": ["n"], "body": "(2*aa*n)"}, {"name": "dn", "params": ["n"], "body": "(bb + 2*aa*n)"}, {"name": "en", "params": ["n"], "body": "(cc + 4*aa*n)"}], "questiontext": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">התכנסות של תתי־סדרות</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">בחינת התנהגות לאורך סדרות אינדקסים שונות</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><div>תהא הסדרה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:18px;margin:8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle a_n={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<div>לכל אחת מתתי־הסדרות הבאות קבעו אם היא <b>מתכנסת</b>.</div></div><div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<thead><tr style=\"background:#F5F1F8;color:#4b1f6f;\"><th style=\"padding:10px;\">תת־סדרה</th><th style=\"padding:10px;\">התכנסות</th></tr></thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle b_n=a_{{{CT:1}}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans1]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle c_n=a_{{{CT:2}}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans2]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle d_n=a_{{{CT:3}}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans3]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;font-size:17px;\">\\(\\displaystyle e_n=a_{{{CT:4}}}\\)</td>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-top:1px solid #D9D1DD;text-align:center;\">[[input:ans4]]<div style=\"margin-top:10px;padding-top:9px;border-top:1px solid #EEECEF;\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#665f6b;margin-bottom:4px;\">בדיקת ההקלדה</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:isolate;text-align:center;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div></div></td>\n</tr></tbody></table></div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div title=\"BGU_STACK_V5\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937;line-height:1.65;text-align:right;\">\n<div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:10px;\">פתרון</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#665f6b;margin-top:3px;\">התכנסות של תתי־סדרות</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:16px;\"><p>כאן \\(\\displaystyle a_n=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi n}{2{{CT:5}}}\\right)\\). נציב בכל פעם את אינדקס תת־הסדרה.</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_{{{CT:5}}n}=\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi n}{2}\\right)\\), ולכן הערכים מתנדנדים ותת־הסדרה אינה מתכנסת.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_{2{{CT:5}}n}=\\sin\\left(\\pi n\\right)=0\\), ולכן תת־הסדרה מתכנסת ל-\\(\\displaystyle 0\\).</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_{{{CT:6}}+2{{CT:5}}n}=\\left(-1\\right)^n\\sin\\left(\\frac{{{CT:6}}\\pi}{2{{CT:5}}}\\right)\\). מאחר ש-\\(\\displaystyle 1\\le {{CT:6}}&lt; {{CT:5}}\\), המשרעת אינה אפס ולכן תת־הסדרה אינה מתכנסת.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle a_{{{CT:7}}+4{{CT:5}}n}=\\sin\\left(\\frac{{{CT:7}}\\pi}{2{{CT:5}}}\\right)\\), כלומר תת־הסדרה קבועה ולכן מתכנסת.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>האפשרויות מוצגות בשאלה בסדר אקראי.</p></div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"margin-top:12px;\">[[feedback:Result]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">התשובה נכונה חלקית.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "[[BASIC-ALGEBRA]]", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "dropdown", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "LL:2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "subseq[1][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.25, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">טעית בנוגע לסדרה&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[b_n\\]</p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans2", "tans": "subseq[2][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">טעית בנוגע לסדרה&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[c_n\\]</p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans3", "tans": "subseq[3][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">טעית בנוגע לסדרה&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[d_n\\]</p>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans4", "tans": "subseq[4][2]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.25, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-4-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\">טעית בנוגע לסדרה&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\[e_n\\]</p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["aa", "bb", "cc", "subseq"], "nvariants": 50}